                <pb facs="0487" n="415" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg415"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 16948/2.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Thompson to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-02-13"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 13,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson reports that the foreign office has advised him of the arrest of
                    Rodriguez and asks that papers be forwarded as soon as possible.</p>
            </div>
